  "title": "Battle of Plassey",
  "summary": "On 23 June 1757 Robert Clive's East India Company force defeated the Nawab of Bengal, Siraj ud-Daulah, near Plassey on the Bhagirathi. Mir Jafar, commanding the Nawab's cavalry, held back after a secret deal. Mir Jafar became nawab as a Company-dependent ruler, a step towards British rule in India.",
