  "reviewer_note": "Figures differ and are left out of the summary: Nawab's army about 50,000 (both); Company about 3,000 (NAM) versus roughly 2,100 plus sailors (WHE); Company dead 22 killed and 50 wounded (NAM) versus about 50 fatalities (WHE); Nawab over 500 casualties. 'Secret deal' with Mir Jafar: WHE says he promised not to fight; the bribe detail was not read on an opened page. Pin is the village of Palashi, not the exact field.",
